{"id":"risk_001","split":"dev","task":"risk","query":"我们在挪威运营零售门店，结账时默认把顾客加入会员俱乐部，并用一个总括勾选框同意画像、营销和数据共享。请按 GDPR 识别法律风险并找相似案例。","language":"zh-CN","difficulty":"hard","retrieval_k":8,"relevance":[{"evidence_id":"law_unit:eu_gdpr_2016_679:article_4:paragraph_11","grade":3,"required":false,"rationale":"总括同意需要满足 freely given、specific、informed 和 unambiguous 的定义。"},{"evidence_id":"law_unit:eu_gdpr_2016_679:article_6:paragraph_1:point_a","grade":3,"required":false,"rationale":"场景以同意作为处理合法性基础，需要满足 Article 6(1)(a)。"},{"evidence_id":"law_unit:eu_gdpr_2016_679:article_7:paragraph_2","grade":3,"required":false,"rationale":"总括勾选框必须与其他事项清楚区分，并以清晰、易懂的形式呈现。"},{"evidence_id":"law_unit:eu_gdpr_2016_679:recital_32","grade":3,"required":false,"rationale":"Recital 32 明确排除预勾选和不作为，并要求多目的处理取得相应同意。"},{"evidence_id":"case:gdprhub:10052","grade":3,"required":true,"rationale":"挪威 Elkjøp 客户俱乐部案与多目的捆绑同意高度相似，但案例材料未表明默认入会。"}],"coverage_groups":[{"name":"law","evidence_ids":["law_unit:eu_gdpr_2016_679:article_4:paragraph_11","law_unit:eu_gdpr_2016_679:article_6:paragraph_1:point_a","law_unit:eu_gdpr_2016_679:article_7:paragraph_2","law_unit:eu_gdpr_2016_679:recital_32"],"min_hits":2},{"name":"case","evidence_ids":["case:gdprhub:10052"],"min_hits":1}],"expected_limitations":["案例相似不代表当前业务必然违法。","Elkjøp 案涉及多目的捆绑同意，但现有摘要未表明顾客被默认加入会员。","GDPRhub 内容是二手案例摘要。"],"tags":["norway","retail","customer-club","bundled-consent","risk"],"annotation":{"status":"gold","method":"ai_assisted_pooled_corpus_review","reviewer":"OpenAI Codex","reviewed_at":"2026-07-23"}}
{"id":"risk_002","split":"dev","task":"risk","query":"我们在比利时从第三方购买联系人名单，再将姓名和联系方式转售给广告商做直接营销，但拿不出每个人的同意记录。请按 GDPR 分析风险并提供案例依据。","language":"zh-CN","difficulty":"hard","retrieval_k":8,"relevance":[{"evidence_id":"law_unit:eu_gdpr_2016_679:article_5:paragraph_1:point_a","grade":3,"required":false,"rationale":"缺少透明、可证明的合法处理涉及公平和合法性原则。"},{"evidence_id":"law_unit:eu_gdpr_2016_679:article_6:paragraph_1","grade":3,"required":false,"rationale":"转售和直接营销必须具备 Article 6(1) 下的合法基础。"},{"evidence_id":"law_unit:eu_gdpr_2016_679:article_6:paragraph_1:point_a","grade":3,"required":false,"rationale":"如果业务实际依赖同意，Article 6(1)(a) 是直接的合法性基础。"},{"evidence_id":"law_unit:eu_gdpr_2016_679:article_7","grade":3,"required":false,"rationale":"如果依赖同意，控制者必须能够证明数据主体确已同意相关处理。"},{"evidence_id":"law_unit:eu_gdpr_2016_679:article_24","grade":2,"required":false,"rationale":"Article 24 要求控制者采取措施并能够证明处理符合 GDPR。"},{"evidence_id":"law_unit:eu_gdpr_2016_679:article_21:paragraph_2","grade":2,"required":false,"rationale":"Article 21(2) 规定数据主体可随时反对用于直接营销的处理。"},{"evidence_id":"law_unit:eu_gdpr_2016_679:recital_32","grade":2,"required":false,"rationale":"Recital 32 说明有效同意需要积极行为并覆盖相应处理目的。"},{"evidence_id":"case:gdprhub:10076","grade":3,"required":false,"rationale":"INFOBEL 数据经纪商转售个人数据且无法证明同意，与场景高度相似。"},{"evidence_id":"case:gdprhub:9671","grade":3,"required":false,"rationale":"较早的 INFOBEL 案同样审查购买和转售个人数据用于直接营销时能否证明同意。"},{"evidence_id":"case:gdprhub:9259","grade":2,"required":false,"rationale":"Canal+ 案涉及使用第三方收集的笼统合作伙伴同意开展电子营销，但不涉及数据转售。"}],"coverage_groups":[{"name":"legal_basis","evidence_ids":["law_unit:eu_gdpr_2016_679:article_5:paragraph_1:point_a","law_unit:eu_gdpr_2016_679:article_6:paragraph_1","law_unit:eu_gdpr_2016_679:article_6:paragraph_1:point_a"],"min_hits":1},{"name":"consent_proof","evidence_ids":["law_unit:eu_gdpr_2016_679:article_7","law_unit:eu_gdpr_2016_679:article_24","law_unit:eu_gdpr_2016_679:recital_32"],"min_hits":1},{"name":"case","evidence_ids":["case:gdprhub:10076","case:gdprhub:9671","case:gdprhub:9259"],"min_hits":1}],"expected_limitations":["案例相似不代表当前业务必然违法。","Canal+ 案涉及第三方营销同意，但不涉及个人数据转售。","GDPRhub 内容是二手案例摘要。"],"tags":["belgium","data-broker","resale","direct-marketing","risk"],"annotation":{"status":"gold","method":"ai_assisted_pooled_corpus_review","reviewer":"OpenAI Codex","reviewed_at":"2026-07-23"}}
{"id":"risk_003","split":"dev","task":"risk","query":"我们面向克罗地亚用户的网站在访客点击同意按钮之前就设置广告 cookies，并把“继续浏览”视为同意。请按 GDPR 分析风险并找监管案例。","language":"zh-CN","difficulty":"hard","retrieval_k":8,"relevance":[{"evidence_id":"law_unit:eu_gdpr_2016_679:article_6:paragraph_1:point_a","grade":3,"required":false,"rationale":"以同意为 cookie 处理基础时需要在处理前取得有效同意。"},{"evidence_id":"law_unit:eu_gdpr_2016_679:article_7","grade":3,"required":false,"rationale":"Article 7 规定控制者证明同意及撤回等条件。"},{"evidence_id":"law_unit:eu_gdpr_2016_679:article_4:paragraph_11","grade":3,"required":false,"rationale":"“继续浏览”必须满足自由、具体、知情且明确的积极意思表示定义。"},{"evidence_id":"law_unit:eu_gdpr_2016_679:recital_32","grade":3,"required":false,"rationale":"Recital 32 明确指出沉默或不作为不能构成同意。"},{"evidence_id":"case:gdprhub:9890","grade":3,"required":false,"rationale":"克罗地亚 cookie 案与同意前设置 cookies 的事实高度相似。"},{"evidence_id":"case:gdprhub:7843","grade":3,"required":false,"rationale":"另一宗克罗地亚网站案件同样涉及同意前处理及多目的 cookie banner。"},{"evidence_id":"case:gdprhub:5548","grade":2,"required":false,"rationale":"法国 Microsoft/Bing 执法案涉及非必要 cookies 在同意前写入，但适用法国 ePrivacy 实施法。"},{"evidence_id":"law_unit:eu_gdpr_2016_679:recital_42","grade":2,"required":false,"rationale":"Recital 42 补充控制者证明同意以及知情、自由选择的要求。"}],"coverage_groups":[{"name":"law","evidence_ids":["law_unit:eu_gdpr_2016_679:article_6:paragraph_1:point_a","law_unit:eu_gdpr_2016_679:article_7","law_unit:eu_gdpr_2016_679:article_4:paragraph_11","law_unit:eu_gdpr_2016_679:recital_32","law_unit:eu_gdpr_2016_679:recital_42"],"min_hits":2},{"name":"case","evidence_ids":["case:gdprhub:9890","case:gdprhub:7843","case:gdprhub:5548"],"min_hits":1}],"expected_limitations":["还需结合适用的 ePrivacy 国内实施法。","Microsoft/Bing 案适用法国国内法，法域不同。","GDPRhub 内容是二手案例摘要。"],"tags":["croatia","cookies","prior-consent","risk"],"annotation":{"status":"gold","method":"ai_assisted_pooled_corpus_review","reviewer":"OpenAI Codex","reviewed_at":"2026-07-23"}}
{"id":"risk_004","split":"dev","task":"risk","query":"我们在意大利经营健身房，前会员要求删除账户和训练记录，但三个月没有处理，理由只是系统迁移。请按 GDPR 识别风险并给出相似执法案例。","language":"zh-CN","difficulty":"hard","retrieval_k":8,"relevance":[{"evidence_id":"law_unit:eu_gdpr_2016_679:article_17","grade":3,"required":true,"rationale":"场景直接涉及 GDPR Article 17 删除权及例外。"},{"evidence_id":"law_unit:eu_gdpr_2016_679:article_12:paragraph_3","grade":2,"required":true,"rationale":"三个月未处理涉及数据主体请求的答复期限。"},{"evidence_id":"case:gdprhub:9868","grade":3,"required":true,"rationale":"意大利 GetFIT 健身房未执行删除请求的案件与场景高度相似。"},{"evidence_id":"case:gdprhub:6008","grade":2,"required":false,"rationale":"另一宗意大利案件涉及控制者逾期响应会员删除请求，但主体不是健身房。"},{"evidence_id":"law_unit:eu_gdpr_2016_679:article_17:paragraph_1","grade":2,"required":false,"rationale":"Article 17(1) 单独列出控制者应无不当延迟删除数据的触发情形。"},{"evidence_id":"law_unit:eu_gdpr_2016_679:article_12","grade":2,"required":false,"rationale":"Article 12 完整规定数据主体权利请求的透明信息和处理方式。"}],"coverage_groups":[{"name":"erasure_law","evidence_ids":["law_unit:eu_gdpr_2016_679:article_17","law_unit:eu_gdpr_2016_679:article_17:paragraph_1"],"min_hits":1},{"name":"deadline_law","evidence_ids":["law_unit:eu_gdpr_2016_679:article_12:paragraph_3","law_unit:eu_gdpr_2016_679:article_12"],"min_hits":1},{"name":"case","evidence_ids":["case:gdprhub:9868"],"min_hits":1}],"expected_limitations":["是否必须删除仍取决于 Article 17(3) 等例外是否适用。","GetFIT 案的摘要记载技术错误，并非系统迁移。","GDPRhub 内容是二手案例摘要。"],"tags":["italy","gym","erasure-request","delay","risk"],"annotation":{"status":"gold","method":"ai_assisted_pooled_corpus_review","reviewer":"OpenAI Codex","reviewed_at":"2026-07-23"}}
{"id":"risk_005","split":"test","task":"risk","query":"法国公共就业平台只使用普通密码保护员工远程访问，攻击者盗用员工账号后导出数千万人的身份数据。请按 GDPR 分析安全义务和处罚风险，并找相似案例。","language":"zh-CN","difficulty":"hard","retrieval_k":8,"relevance":[{"evidence_id":"law_unit:eu_gdpr_2016_679:article_32","grade":3,"required":true,"rationale":"弱认证和大规模泄露直接涉及 Article 32 的适当技术与组织措施。"},{"evidence_id":"law_unit:eu_gdpr_2016_679:article_83","grade":2,"required":true,"rationale":"Article 83 规定是否处罚及确定罚款数额时应考虑的因素。"},{"evidence_id":"case:gdprhub:9780","grade":3,"required":true,"rationale":"France Travail 案涉及员工账号被利用、大规模数据泄露和安全措施不足。"},{"evidence_id":"law_unit:eu_gdpr_2016_679:article_32:paragraph_1","grade":2,"required":false,"rationale":"Article 32(1) 具体要求采取与风险相适应的技术和组织措施。"},{"evidence_id":"law_unit:eu_gdpr_2016_679:article_5:paragraph_1:point_f","grade":2,"required":false,"rationale":"Article 5(1)(f) 规定完整性与保密性原则，包括防止未经授权访问。"}],"coverage_groups":[{"name":"security_law","evidence_ids":["law_unit:eu_gdpr_2016_679:article_32","law_unit:eu_gdpr_2016_679:article_32:paragraph_1","law_unit:eu_gdpr_2016_679:article_5:paragraph_1:point_f"],"min_hits":1},{"name":"penalty_law","evidence_ids":["law_unit:eu_gdpr_2016_679:article_83"],"min_hits":1},{"name":"case","evidence_ids":["case:gdprhub:9780"],"min_hits":1}],"expected_limitations":["处罚金额取决于具体事实、法域和监管裁量。","GDPRhub 内容是二手案例摘要。"],"tags":["france","public-employment","weak-authentication","data-breach","risk"],"annotation":{"status":"gold","method":"ai_assisted_pooled_corpus_review","reviewer":"OpenAI Codex","reviewed_at":"2026-07-23"}}
{"id":"risk_006","split":"test","task":"risk","query":"比利时房地产中介收到租户的数据访问请求后一直搁置，四年后才回复，而且没有说明延期原因。请按 GDPR 分析风险并找类似案例。","language":"zh-CN","difficulty":"hard","retrieval_k":8,"relevance":[{"evidence_id":"law_unit:eu_gdpr_2016_679:article_15","grade":3,"required":true,"rationale":"租户请求访问其个人数据，直接适用 Article 15。"},{"evidence_id":"law_unit:eu_gdpr_2016_679:article_12:paragraph_3","grade":3,"required":true,"rationale":"四年延迟明显涉及 Article 12(3) 的及时答复要求。"},{"evidence_id":"case:gdprhub:9981","grade":3,"required":true,"rationale":"比利时房地产中介四年后回复访问请求的案件与场景基本一致。"},{"evidence_id":"case:gdprhub:5206","grade":2,"required":false,"rationale":"意大利 Deutsche Bank 案同样认定逾期响应访问请求违反 Articles 12 和 15，但行业和法域不同。"},{"evidence_id":"law_unit:eu_gdpr_2016_679:article_15:paragraph_1","grade":2,"required":false,"rationale":"Article 15(1) 具体列出访问权所涵盖的个人数据和处理信息。"},{"evidence_id":"law_unit:eu_gdpr_2016_679:article_12","grade":2,"required":false,"rationale":"Article 12 完整规定控制者处理数据主体权利请求的方式。"},{"evidence_id":"case:gdprhub:5730","grade":2,"required":false,"rationale":"另一宗比利时案件涉及控制者未及时答复访问和复制请求，但不涉及房地产中介或四年迟延。"}],"coverage_groups":[{"name":"access_law","evidence_ids":["law_unit:eu_gdpr_2016_679:article_15","law_unit:eu_gdpr_2016_679:article_15:paragraph_1"],"min_hits":1},{"name":"deadline_law","evidence_ids":["law_unit:eu_gdpr_2016_679:article_12:paragraph_3","law_unit:eu_gdpr_2016_679:article_12"],"min_hits":1},{"name":"case","evidence_ids":["case:gdprhub:9981"],"min_hits":1}],"expected_limitations":["案例相似不代表当前业务必然违法。","Deutsche Bank 案的行业和法域不同，仅作为访问请求迟延的补充案例。","GDPRhub 内容是二手案例摘要。","APD/GBA 19/2023 同属比利时访问请求迟延案，但行业和迟延时长不同。"],"tags":["belgium","real-estate","access-request","delay","risk"],"annotation":{"status":"gold","method":"ai_assisted_pooled_corpus_review","reviewer":"OpenAI Codex","reviewed_at":"2026-07-23"}}
