{"id":"compare_006","split":"test","task":"compare","query":"比较克罗地亚和奥地利监管实践中 cookie banner 有效同意问题，分别找出案例并说明共同适用的 GDPR 条款。","language":"zh-CN","difficulty":"hard","retrieval_k":10,"relevance":[{"evidence_id":"case:gdprhub:9890","grade":3,"required":false,"rationale":"克罗地亚 AZOP 案涉及 cookie 在有效同意前设置。"},{"evidence_id":"case:gdprhub:7843","grade":3,"required":false,"rationale":"另一宗克罗地亚 AZOP 案涉及同意前处理及未区分 cookie 目的。"},{"evidence_id":"case:gdprhub:9994","grade":3,"required":true,"rationale":"奥地利 BVwG 案涉及监管机构要求修改 cookie banner。"},{"evidence_id":"law_unit:eu_gdpr_2016_679:article_4:paragraph_11","grade":3,"required":false,"rationale":"两国案例都以自由、具体、知情且明确的同意定义为判断基础。"},{"evidence_id":"law_unit:eu_gdpr_2016_679:article_5:paragraph_1:point_a","grade":2,"required":false,"rationale":"两国案例都涉及合法、公平和透明处理原则。"},{"evidence_id":"law_unit:eu_gdpr_2016_679:article_6:paragraph_1:point_a","grade":2,"required":false,"rationale":"两个法域的案例都涉及以同意作为处理基础。"},{"evidence_id":"law_unit:eu_gdpr_2016_679:article_7","grade":2,"required":false,"rationale":"Article 7 是判断 cookie 同意能否被证明和是否有效的共同条款。"}],"coverage_groups":[{"name":"croatia_case","evidence_ids":["case:gdprhub:9890","case:gdprhub:7843"],"min_hits":1},{"name":"austria_case","evidence_ids":["case:gdprhub:9994"],"min_hits":1},{"name":"common_law","evidence_ids":["law_unit:eu_gdpr_2016_679:article_4:paragraph_11","law_unit:eu_gdpr_2016_679:article_5:paragraph_1:point_a","law_unit:eu_gdpr_2016_679:article_6:paragraph_1:point_a","law_unit:eu_gdpr_2016_679:article_7"],"min_hits":2}],"expected_limitations":["GDPRhub 内容是二手案例摘要，案例程序背景需要结合原始决定核验。"],"tags":["croatia","austria","cookies","case-comparison"],"annotation":{"status":"gold","method":"ai_assisted_pooled_corpus_review","reviewer":"OpenAI Codex","reviewed_at":"2026-07-23"}}
